Accordingly, the benefit of doubt has to be extended to the accused and hence, the Point Nos.1 to 4 are answered in the "Negative".
12. Point No.5 :- In view of the findings on above points, I proceed to pass the following;
ORDER Acting under section 248(1) of Cr.P.C. the accused is acquitted of the offence punishable under Secs.498A, 324, 504, 506 of IPC.

